  "summary": "Promote and register the selected OD-012 compiler baseline.",
  "why": "The accepted operator choice must be canonical design authority, a fixed-point-safe zero-scope decision card, and an integration registration before CC-D12 can complete or CC-002 can be authorized. The revised ownership text prevents CC-D12 from requiring artifacts that only CC-002 can materialize."
